{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id24091316"}, "name":{"label":"Peter Wooley"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-12-17T20:58:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"11.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"13526229644"}, "title":{"label":"Every day, for years"}, "content":{"label":"Streaks was the first habit-tracking app to work with my broken brain. I've used it every day since 2018 to remind me about the hygiene I would always forget (I floss daily now!). It's helped me learn new skills, work out, and stay on top of friendships all while having a cute, theme-able interface I always enjoy using.\n\nI recommend it to everyone in my life and now I'm recommending it to you!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"5"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"5"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id402127220"}, "name":{"label":"Skippinder"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-30T02:16:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"11.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"13458083376"}, "title":{"label":"Love the app, but 24 tasks is a dealbreaker"}, "content":{"label":"What the title says; it’s a fantastic app, and I’m\nstill going to use it until I can find a way to move my existing task data elsewhere, but it feels absurd to limit one to just 4 pages. I would gladly pay several times the price of the app to purchase more pages, but that it’s against their ‘philosophy’ to have more than 24 tasks simply rubs me the wrong way", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
