{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id213584010"}, "name":{"label":"Berdunn"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-21T06:40:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"11.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"13295337482"}, "title":{"label":"Great App with Helpful Support"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded this app to help me track all of my different habits in one place. I had trouble getting it to count my steps accurately and after much research, I finally decided to reach out to their customer assistance. They responded within a day, on a Sunday and solved my problem! It works perfect perfectly now I changed my start of day two 1 AM rather than 9 AM (thats why my step count wasnt matching apple health).  Great app, great service!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"6"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"7"}}, 
