{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id18878510"}, "name":{"label":"organizedthought"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-30T23:44:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"11.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"13207927435"}, "title":{"label":"Keeps me motivated & on top of things."}, "content":{"label":"This app is exactly what I had been searching for. The integrations with AppleHealth are awesome. \n\nFeatures  I’d like to see is a count up option for the timer.  I have a reading goal & tidying goal that I want to hit daily, but would like to track overage time to know when I am increasing regularly. \n\nAn ability to see/ scroll through and print out the notes sections by task or by all for a date range. \n\nGive me more tasks. \n\nI’d love to have a separate 12 for work tasks \n\nAlso an option for integrating time spent listening to Apple podcast app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id86300354"}, "name":{"label":"Chihlee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-29T06:44:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"11.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"13200443520"}, "title":{"label":"Not super intuitive"}, "content":{"label":"Feels like kind of a steep learning curve to do anything regarding editing or moving tasks to a different task", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id7688587"}, "name":{"label":"Muffin McDanger"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-24T18:04:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"11.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"13180845529"}, "title":{"label":"Want to love"}, "content":{"label":"But the UX has always felt too limiting and uncustomizable. \n\nWould love an OPTION for a customizable view - like a list view or smaller icons (or even sub tasks) instead of the 6 icon grid on 4 pages, which feels very outdated for more advanced use cases. \n\nI find the limited layout with six icons per page honestly stilfing because of its rigidness. While it probably works for other users, it would be great to have options to make it look and feel the way each user would work for their routine. \n\nFor instance - The new medication tracker couldn’t work for me because I’ve already maxed out the habits I can add. \n\nI’d even pay for this as an add on.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
