{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id39502143"}, "name":{"label":"Hrmpw"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-07T15:53:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"10.4.15"}, "id":{"label":"13111371180"}, "title":{"label":"Good task reminder"}, "content":{"label":"I struggle with repeating tasks like taking medicine or vitamins so this app does a great job. My only complaint is the “smart” notifications aren’t very smart. I’ll complete one day of a task tracked weekly and get a reminder an hour later.  If I need to do something 3 times a week it should be easy to predict the best times for an alert.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id481348392"}, "name":{"label":"peachcourier"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-04T11:04:35-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"10.4.15"}, "id":{"label":"13098714560"}, "title":{"label":"Still the best habit streaks app out there, some suggestions for future versions"}, "content":{"label":"I love:\n- that the UI has stayed the same since its initial release\n- still easy to use, tap and hold mechanic to complete a streak is very intuitive\n- haptic feedback when something is marked complete\n\nI like:\n- customization options (including backgrounds and color schemes), though I think it would be cool if there were a larger array of completion sound effects to choose from\n\nI dislike:\n- reminder notification is kind of negative (“you will lose your streak of X days if you don’t do this today”), wish that it was more positive and motivational in nature", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id35641603"}, "name":{"label":"Scottggg"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-09-02T16:25:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"10.4.15"}, "id":{"label":"13091898748"}, "title":{"label":"Horrible UI"}, "content":{"label":"Worst user interface ever. It’s completely unlearnable. And if you accidentally marks a task as complete there is no clear way to undo it.  The watch complications are also horrible. Shame on the developers for not hiring an experienced designer.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id618901574"}, "name":{"label":"Permanent_Impermanence"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-08-29T11:18:09-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"10.4.15"}, "id":{"label":"13075459267"}, "title":{"label":"Good but Needs Improvement"}, "content":{"label":"Overall this is a very useful app. The way that it keeps track of your data is very clean and the Ui is very ergonomic. The only downside for me is that there are a limit of 24 streaks for the entire app. If they were to double it to 48 it would enable me to put all my tasks into one place so I can keep track of progress. If they just allowed more possible streaks this app would be perfect.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
