{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1206798476"}, "name":{"label":"andgate"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-15T07:35:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"10.4.11"}, "id":{"label":"12894788718"}, "title":{"label":"Too Opinionated"}, "content":{"label":"UX is clunky and you can’t have more than 4 pages (or 24 habits). Also, undoing logged actions requires shaking the phone, instead of just being a simple menu option. This app tries to hard to be unique and opinionated and falls flat on its face.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id12034902"}, "name":{"label":"cmbard"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-13T06:19:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"10.4.9"}, "id":{"label":"12886751630"}, "title":{"label":"Great but limited"}, "content":{"label":"This is a beautiful app in its simplicity and function, as well as the wide variety of ways that you can add tasks and watch your streaks grow.\n\nI use it almost daily and have given up almost all of my other habit trackers. That said, there are two areas where it could use some improvement.\n\nThe first is the up next feature on Apple Watch complications, which tends to be behave a little flaky. \n\nThe other is that it’s limited to 24 habits. I wrote to the developer quite some time ago, and they said that they were working on that. However, nothing has happened. I don’t really understand how adding a few more screens could be that much more complex, but perhaps they’re just not interested.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
