{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id109356154"}, "name":{"label":"colin514"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-26T17:00:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"10.4.6"}, "id":{"label":"12702129039"}, "title":{"label":"Is this the missing key??"}, "content":{"label":"Wasn’t sure what to expect from Streaks. Sure, it has high ratings and a simple, clean interface- but how does it hold up against my stubborn ways? Well, I’m here to say so far it holds up extremely well! Has it only been one day of usage? Sure, but I’ve gotten more accomplished in that day than I have in the past week. Streaks seems to hit that perfect balance between simplicity and functionality. Many of the tasks can be automatically tracked/completed by syncing with your phone’s data, which has proved to be very handy since I don’t like having to manually track tasks. I adore all the customization features and various widgets that are available. The Apple Watch app is fantastic too, as you can easily keep an eye on/mark off tasks as you go about your day. My only improvement would be that I wish the watch app allowed you to view only uncompleted and upcoming tasks at the touch of a button, like is possible on the phone app. Other than that and possibly adding in even more customization features, it’s a truly great app that I hope continues to motivate me to better myself every day!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=963034692&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
